        ],
        "en": [
          "On a quiet pedestrian street in downtown Beauvais, you'll find the town's one and only cheese shop.\nLeroy du fromage is Stéphane and Célia's store, where you can discover the secrets of their cheeses.\nSoft, fresh, pressed or blue-veined, goat's or cow's milk, wine pairings, beer pairings, food pairings, so many flavors to savor and save!\n\nOpen Tuesday to Saturday, 9am to 1pm and 3pm to 7pm."
        ],
        "it": [
